-- title:
--   Dimension $24$
-- statement:
--   **The rung $r=24$ of Challenge 7.** The sphere-packing constant of $\mathbb R^{24}$ equals its lattice-packing constant:
--
--   $$\Delta_{24}=\Delta_{24}^L .$$
--
--   Both equal $\pi^{12}/12!$, attained by the Leech lattice.
-- source:
--   H. Cohn, A. Kumar, S. D. Miller, D. Radchenko, M. Viazovska, The sphere packing problem in dimension 24, Ann. of Math. 185 (2017), 1017–1033, https://doi.org/10.4007/annals.2017.185.3.8

